@prefix crm: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix intro: <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "INT2 Actualization of Feature"@en,
        "INT2 Attualizzazione di caratteristica"@it ;
    rdfs:comment "In DeSMòS, INT2 Actualization of Feature is referenced only as a member of the original union range of R12 has referred to entity and R13 has referring entity, and of the union domain of their inverses; it is not instantiated in the DeSMòS corpus."@en,
        "In DeSMòS, INT2 Actualization of Feature è referenziata solo come membro dell'unione che costituisce il range originale di R12 has referred to entity e R13 has referring entity, e il domain delle loro inverse; non è istanziata nel corpus DeSMòS."@it ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy intro: ;
    rdfs:subClassOf crm:E28_Conceptual_Object .

